{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"gongsuntao-e-o193","title":"谦死年六十三张昭等为之哀辞","accounts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-a-8b4c3b384f5c19e5c440","label":"裴注·吴书","text":"谦死年六十三张昭等为之哀辞","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"等为之哀辞颂谦令舒及卢牧幽暨徐之德","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00"]},{"person":"wudi-p0095","role":"死时年六十三","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00","source_order":[8,143,10],"order":2003}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0133","name":"张昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0095","name":"陶谦","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-e4de8d38a67f611d3b00","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-af1c9bd0f2672b2be65e","layer":"pei","quote":"谦死时，年六十三。张昭等为之哀辞曰：‘猗欤使君，君侯将军。膺秉懿德，允武允文。体足刚直，守以温仁。令舒及卢，遗爱于民。牧幽暨徐，甘棠是均。憬憬夷、貊，赖侯以清。蠢蠢妖寇，匪侯不宁。唯帝念绩，爵命以彰。既牧且侯，启土溧阳。遂升上将，受号安东。将平世难，社稷是崇。降年不永，奄忽殂薨。丧覆失恃，民知困穷。曾不旬日，五郡溃崩。哀我人斯，将谁仰凭？追思靡及，仰叫皇穹。呜呼哀哉","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a7e048c9322218d83425","start":10,"end":194,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
